                <mxCell id="j4-vaOaXRd9azb2VD8BT-0" parent="JNDm9A9PgpPNT8YRd4aM-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div class=&quot;code-block ng-tns-c2427595516-43 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2427595516-43&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;animated-opacity ng-tns-c2427595516-43&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;ng-tns-c2427595516-43&quot;&gt;&lt;code role=&quot;text&quot; class=&quot;code-container formatted ng-tns-c2427595516-43 no-decoration-radius&quot;&gt;┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐&lt;br/&gt;│ 1. TILE MODE 01: Q_tile x K_tile^T -&amp;gt; S_tile -&amp;gt; Softmax -&amp;gt; P_tile                      │&lt;br/&gt;│    - Q_tile : [M_Q, d_k] = [8, d_k]       (8 Query Tokens, broadcast qua ext_act)      │&lt;br/&gt;│    - K_tile : [16, d_k]                   (BỊ KHÓA CỨNG: đúng 16 Keys trên 16 Lanes!)  │&lt;br/&gt;│    - S_tile : [M_Q, 16]  = [8, 16]        (8 Queries x 16 Keys, nằm ở Slots 8..15)     │&lt;br/&gt;│    - P_tile : [M_Q, 16]  = [8, 16]        (8 gói FP4, mỗi gói 16 keys, nằm ở p_fifo)   │&lt;br/&gt;├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤&lt;br/&gt;│ 2. TILE MODE 10: P_tile x V_tile -&amp;gt; O_tile (Online Rescaling &amp;amp; Accumulation)           │&lt;br/&gt;│    - P_tile : [M_Q, 16]  = [8, 16]        (Đọc trực tiếp từ đầu ra của p_fifo)         │&lt;br/&gt;│    - V_tile : [16, 16]                    (BỊ KHÓA CỨNG: 16 Keys x 16 Channels/sub-blk)│&lt;br/&gt;│    - O_tile : [M_Q, 16]  = [8, 16]        (8 Queries x 16 Channels, nằm ở Slots 0..7)  │&lt;br/&gt;└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;" vertex="1">
