                <mxCell id="j4-vaOaXRd9azb2VD8BT-14" parent="JNDm9A9PgpPNT8YRd4aM-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div class=&quot;code-block ng-tns-c2427595516-44 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2427595516-44&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;animated-opacity ng-tns-c2427595516-44&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;ng-tns-c2427595516-44&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code-block ng-tns-c2427595516-276 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2427595516-276&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;animated-opacity ng-tns-c2427595516-276&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;ng-tns-c2427595516-276&quot;&gt;&lt;code role=&quot;text&quot; class=&quot;code-container formatted ng-tns-c2427595516-276 no-decoration-radius&quot;&gt;Vòng 1 : Duyệt qua các HEADS (h = 0 .. H-1) (&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(234, 107, 102);&quot;&gt;LOOP #4&lt;/b&gt;)&lt;br&gt;  Vòng 2 : Duyệt qua các TILE QUERY (qi = 0 .. Q_TILES-1, mỗi tile M_Q = 8 tokens) (&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(234, 107, 102);&quot;&gt;LOOP #3&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;  &lt;br&gt;    Vòng 3 (MỚI BỔ SUNG CHO d_v) : Duyệt qua các lát cắt của d_v (dvi = 0 .. DV_TILES-1, mỗi lát 16 channels) (&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(234, 107, 102);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;LOOP #&lt;/b&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;br&gt;      ── Khởi tạo dòng mới: cfg_row_start_i = 1 ──&lt;br&gt;      &lt;br&gt;      Vòng 4 : Duyệt qua TOÀN BỘ CHUỖI KEY/VALUE (kj = 0 .. KV_TILES-1, mỗi tile 16 Keys) (&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(234, 107, 102);&quot;&gt;LOOP #1&lt;/b&gt;)&lt;br&gt;        [Mode 01] Tính Q_i * K_j^T -&amp;gt; Softmax -&amp;gt; p_fifo (8 gói P)&lt;br&gt;        [Mode 10] Pop 8 gói P -&amp;gt; Nhân với lát cắt dvi của V (16 channels) -&amp;gt; Tích lũy Slots 0..7&lt;br&gt;        &lt;br&gt;      ── Thoát Vòng 4 (Xong toàn bộ chuỗi KV cho 16 channels này) ──&lt;br&gt;      Drain Slots 0..7 sang final_normalizer -&amp;gt; Xuất 16 channels FP16 của O ra bộ nhớ ngoài&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="190" width="810" x="1440" y="190" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
